abstract: >-
  Python implementation of a seven-step uncertainty-aware allometric modelling
  pipeline, accompanied by a harmonised Gazi Bay Rhizophora mucronata
  destructive-harvest dataset for demonstrating biomass equation development
  and uncertainty reporting.
